    {
      "id": "p01",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "green-line-ops",
      "text": "Saturday late service: the last eastbound and the last westbound Green Line trains both leave Fennick St at 11:40 pm.",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T15:00:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p02",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "corvale-scanner",
      "text": "Quillfeather Hall show tonight: doors at 7 pm, music until 11. Fennick St is the closest Green Line stop.",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T17:30:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p03",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "green-line-ops",
      "text": "Westbound Green Line trains are running about 5 minutes late because of a signal check at Ash Yard.",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T18:10:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p04",
      "kind": "reply",
      "author_id": "green-line-ops",
      "text": "The signal check at Ash Yard is finished. Westbound trains are back on schedule.",
      "parent_id": "p03",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T18:40:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p05",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "mika-sorensen",
      "text": "Board at Fennick St just switched to this. Last Green Line train tonight is canceled??",
      "links": [],
      "media": [
        {
          "asset_id": "fennick-board-crop",
          "alt_text": "Cropped photo of a station departure board. Two lines are visible: \"11:40 PM GREEN LINE\" and \"CANCELED\"."
        }
      ],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:05:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p06",
      "kind": "repost",
      "author_id": "devin-hart",
      "source_id": "p05",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:05:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p07",
      "kind": "quote",
      "author_id": "corvale-scanner",
      "text": "Riders report the last Green Line train tonight is canceled. Nothing from @green-line-ops yet.",
      "quoted_id": "p05",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:06:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p08",
      "kind": "quote",
      "author_id": "devin-hart",
      "text": "Of course it's the night of the Quillfeather show. How is anyone getting home?",
      "quoted_id": "p05",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:06:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p09",
      "kind": "quote",
      "author_id": "june-okoro",
      "text": "If you're at Quillfeather tonight, the last Green Line train is apparently canceled. Plan ahead.",
      "quoted_id": "p05",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:07:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "kind": "reply",
      "author_id": "tessa-lu",
      "text": "Which direction? The photo cuts off the destination column.",
      "parent_id": "p05",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:07:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11",
      "kind": "reply",
      "author_id": "mika-sorensen",
      "text": "No idea, I only caught the bottom of the board.",
      "parent_id": "p10",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:08:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "tessa-lu",
      "text": "@green-line-ops Is the last Green Line train canceled tonight? Eastbound, westbound or both?",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:08:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p13",
      "kind": "repost",
      "author_id": "june-okoro",
      "source_id": "p07",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:09:00-07:00"
    },
    {
