      "source_id": "p09",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:09:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p15",
      "kind": "reply",
      "author_id": "corvale-scanner",
      "text": "Several people are asking which direction. We have asked Corvale Regional Transit.",
      "parent_id": "p07",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:09:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p16",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "hal-reyes",
      "text": "Anyone else at Quillfeather? Opening act ran long, main set just started.",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:10:00-07:00"
    },
    {
