    {
      "id": "p18",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "pine-hollow-neighbors",
      "text": "Smoke over the ridge north of Pine Hollow tonight. The county says crews are on the Cinder Fork Fire; no evacuation notices.",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T21:10:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p20",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "tamsen-oem",
      "text": "Cinder Fork Fire, 9:00 am: about 300 acres north of Pine Hollow, 0% contained. No evacuation notices. Updates here and on the county alert page.",
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://alerts.tamsen-county.example/cinder-fork/2026-10-11-0900",
          "title": "Cinder Fork Fire update, Oct. 11, 9:00 am",
          "description": "Tamsen County Emergency Management alert page"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-11T09:00:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p21",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "tamsen-oem",
      "text": "Cinder Fork Fire, 2:00 pm: EVACUATION WARNING for Pine Hollow (zones PH-1 and PH-2). Be ready to leave. Lakeview: no evacuation notice. Next update by 4:30 pm.",
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://alerts.tamsen-county.example/cinder-fork/2026-10-11-1400",
          "title": "Cinder Fork Fire update, Oct. 11, 2:00 pm",
          "description": "Tamsen County Emergency Management alert page"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-11T14:00:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p28",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "alder-glass",
      "text": "Preliminary third-quarter update: unit shipments rose 12% from a year earlier. We report full results Tuesday, Oct. 13, with a call at 5:30 am PT.",
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://investors.alder-glass.example/q3-preliminary",
          "title": "Alder Glass preliminary third-quarter shipments",
          "description": "Investor relations notice"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-12T06:00:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p29",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "odile-park",
      "text": "Alder Glass shipments rose 12%. I read that as real demand: the same installers keep coming back with repeat orders. 1/2",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-12T08:15:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p30",
      "kind": "reply",
      "author_id": "odile-park",
      "text": "2/2 What would change my mind: a next-quarter reorder rate below last year's. That rate isn't out yet; it's the number I'll listen for on Tuesday's call.",
      "parent_id": "p29",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-12T08:17:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p31",
      "kind": "original",
      "author_id": "ravi-castellano",
      "text": "Same 12% shipment rise, different read: distributors filled their shelves early, ahead of the Jan. 1 price increase. Shipments to distributors aren't sales to installers. 1/2",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-12T10:40:00-07:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "p32",
      "kind": "reply",
      "author_id": "ravi-castellano",
      "text": "2/2 If distributors stocked up, next-quarter reorders fall. If @odile-park is right, they hold. The reorder rate hasn't been reported; watch for it on the call.",
      "parent_id": "p31",
      "links": [],
      "media": [],
      "published_at": "2026-10-12T10:42:00-07:00"
    },
